      {
        "native_id": "nd2u2027j60c",
        "status": "investigating",
        "body": "Cloudflare is investigating an issue affecting Cloudflare Gateway DNS-over-TLS (DoT) connections over IPv4. Affected customers may experience connection timeouts and failed DNS resolution.\n\nThis issue is limited to DoT over IPv4. DoT over IPv6, DNS-over-HTTPS (DoH), and standard DNS over UDP/TCP are not affected.\n\nWe are working to identify the cause and restore connectivity. Further updates will be provided as more information becomes available.",
        "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:12:39.28Z"
      },
      {
        "native_id": "i42tujj9i9m3",
        "status": "monitoring",
        "body": "Our team has been able to identify and apply an effective fix for this issue. We are currently monitoring the results.",
